    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73912" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμό-χροια</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sameness of colour,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				5.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				342b20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				18.1.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>even surface of the body, skin,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.74
